        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brockway%2C_Montana"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Brockway once boasted a drive‑in theatre that operated from 1950 to 1962 in the heart of the town.",
